+/*
+ * ARGON: the four things this does, timed apart.
+ *
+ * Maxim: "Зачем перерисовывать интерфейс целиком?"  A fair question, and the
+ * honest answer is that nobody knew what the whole cost 67 to 78 ms on - the
+ * background blit reads 307200 pixels through a transparency test, the tabs
+ * draw city names as TEXT, the dial is a rotating picture, and the window
+ * refresh composes and converts all 640x480 for a view that is 450x443.  Any
+ * of the four could be most of it, and three of the four have a cheaper
